---
const services = [
  {
    text: "Permohonan Informasi Publik",
    link: "https://form.apps.unej.ac.id/dashboard/#/nc/form/ce82c851-1095-428e-b282-0872962ddce8",
  },
  {
    text: "Formulir Keluhan Pelayanan",
    link: "https://form.apps.unej.ac.id/dashboard/#/nc/form/9e30e8db-8ad1-459a-bad2-38a03b0d54ae",
  },
  {
    text: "Keberatan Atas Informasi Publik",
    link: "https://form.apps.unej.ac.id/dashboard/#/nc/form/e3fdbed1-3556-4dac-982c-ed01d5b1eed0",
  },
  {
    text: "Penyalahgunaan Wewenang",
    link: "https://form.apps.unej.ac.id/dashboard/#/nc/form/2be325ab-21e5-44cc-a6b9-5b2b428ab194",
  },
];
---

<section>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-center mb-7 sm-mb-40px">
      <div
        class="col-xl-5 col-lg-6 col-md-10 md-mb-50px"
        data-anime='{ "el": "childs", "translateY": [15, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 600, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 100, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'
      >
        <div class="mb-10px">
          <span
            class="w-25px h-1px d-inline-block bg-base-color me-5px align-middle"
          ></span>
          <span
            class="text-gradient-base-color fs-15 alt-font fw-700 ls-05px text-uppercase d-inline-block align-middle"
          >
            Layanan Publik
          </span>
        </div>

        <h3
          class="fw-600 text-dark-gray ls-minus-2px alt-font"
          data-anime='{ "el": "lines", "translateY": [15, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "delay": 100, "staggervalue": 100, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'
        >
          Fakultas Ekonomi dan Bisnis Universitas Jember
        </h3>

        <p>
          Silahkan gunakan formulir di bawah ini untuk memperoleh informasi
          publik maupun menyampaikan keluhan, keberatan, dan pengaduan Anda.
        </p>

        {
          services.map((item) => (
            <a
              href={item.link}
              class="icon-with-text-style-08 mb-10px link-primary"
            >
              <div class="feature-box feature-box-left-icon-middle overflow-hidden">
                <div class="feature-box-icon feature-box-icon-rounded w-35px h-35px bg-linen rounded-circle me-10px">
                  <i class="fa-solid fa-up-right-from-square fs-14" />
                </div>
                <div class="feature-box-content">
                  <span>{item.text}</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <div
        class="col-lg-6 offset-xl-1 position-relative z-index-1"
        data-anime='{ "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 600, "delay": 100, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'
      >
        <div class="atropos" data-atropos data-atropos-perspective="2450">
          <div class="atropos-scale">
            <div class="atropos-rotate">
              <div class="atropos-inner">
                <img
                  src="https://static.vecteezy.com/system/resources/previews/001/261/040/non_2x/female-call-center-agent-vector.jpg"
                  alt=""
                  class="border-radius-6px"
                />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row mt-5">
      <div
        class="col-12 text-center"
        data-anime='{ "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 600, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'
      >
        <i
          class="bi bi-telephone-inbound text-dark-gray d-inline-block align-middle icon-extra-medium me-5px"
        ></i>
        <div class="fs-18 text-dark-gray d-inline-block align-middle fw-500">
          Kami siap membantu Anda memperoleh informasi dan solusi dengan lebih
          mudah.
          <a
            href="tel:6282337463327"
            class="text-dark-gray text-decoration-line-bottom fw-600"
          >
            Hubungi kami
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="col-12 text-center mt-2"
        data-anime='{ "translateY": [30, 0], "opacity": [0,1], "duration": 600, "delay": 0, "staggervalue": 300, "easing": "easeOutQuad" }'
      >
        <i
          class="bi bi-card-text text-dark-gray d-inline-block align-middle icon-extra-medium me-5px"
        ></i>
        <div class="fs-18 text-dark-gray d-inline-block align-middle fw-500">
          Memiliki pertanyaan, saran, atau keluhan terkait layanan kami?
          <a
            href="https://lapor-feb.unej.my.id"
            class="text-dark-gray text-decoration-line-bottom fw-600"
          >
            Sampaikan di sini
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
